# Scoped to this workspace, so the root .gitignore can stay narrow.
#
# Everything here is something a developer produces while reproducing a CI run by
# hand. The suite drives a CLI that echoes raw provider and tenant error bodies,
# and this repo is public, so a stray capture file is a credential in the diff.

# Any eval config, not just the default filename the root rule covers. `dt-evals
# configure` writes a live tenant token into these.
*.dt-eval.yaml

# Captured CLI output. `--ci` emits JSON, so *.log alone is not enough.
*.out
*.txt
e2e-output.json
runs.json
